The swift demo: an iOS app whose Xcode project App/Shop.xcodeproj uses the local package Packages/Pricing, which uses the local package Packages/Networking, with CocoaPods and the remote packages resolved in the Shop.xcworkspace at the root. The change adds a function and its test to Networking, bumps swift-log in Package.resolved and Alamofire in Podfile.lock. The files are hand-written in the shape the tools write them on a GitHub Actions macOS runner: swiftpm.json as swift package describe --type json writes it for Pricing, the JUnit report xcbeautify --report junit writes for the Shop test plan, the xunit report of swift test --xunit-output for Networking, and the Cobertura report xcresultparser --output-format cobertura converts from the .xcresult.
